		{
			dependencies: ["36D9A2651A27AA32"]
			description: [
				"Serene Seasons changes when many crops grow efficiently. Watch foliage and crop behaviour, diversify what you plant, and keep seed reserves instead of using the last harvest."
				"Store one season of food before expanding livestock. Mixed fields, orchards, fishing and preserved meals are safer than depending on a single enormous crop."
				"In the field-guide lore, a full pantry is a promise: the settlement can welcome a lost traveller without becoming poor itself."
				"Serene Seasons can affect outdoor crop fertility. Diversify fields, keep reserve seed, use protected growing where appropriate, and let JEI plus the season indicator explain a slow harvest before expanding the farm."
			]
			id: "000927068CCE0DB0"
