		{
			dependencies: ["000927068CCE0DB0"]
			description: [
				"Central Kitchen provides Create-compatible methods for food processing and storage integrations, especially around Farmer's Delight. It is the bridge between a working kitchen and a visible food factory."
				"Choose one meal with a repeatable ingredient chain. Automate washing, cutting, mixing or packing only where JEI shows an integration recipe; ordinary Cooking Pot recipes may still need the correct containers."
				"Keep a manual kitchen beside the line. Automation should supply the community, not make it impossible to cook when a belt jams."
				"Central Kitchen and Slice and Dice automate Farmer's Delight by moving ingredients through familiar Create logistics. Stabilise the manual recipe first so the machine has a known correct result to reproduce."
			]
			id: "0D4B75EF5618911F"
