		{
			dependencies: ["0D4B75EF5618911F"]
			description: [
				"Slice and Dice focuses on Create automation for Farmer's Delight processes. Its machines reproduce preparation steps that normally use knives, cutting boards and kitchen handling."
				"Ponder its components, then verify the exact recipe in JEI. Pay attention to held tools, basin positions and output sides; a correct ingredient in the wrong process is still the wrong recipe."
				"Start with a high-volume staple such as vegetables or dough. A tiny line that reliably feeds everyone is a better lesson than an unfinished wall of every food in JEI."
				"Central Kitchen and Slice and Dice automate Farmer's Delight by moving ingredients through familiar Create logistics. Stabilise the manual recipe first so the machine has a known correct result to reproduce."
