		{
			dependencies: ["7F45F36FB147AD0A"]
			description: [
				"HerbalBrews adds tea plants to suitable biomes. Gather leaves and blossoms responsibly, then replant near the homestead."
				"JEI shows which leaves become each drink and which blocks are used for drying."
				"Herbal Brews has several preparation stages, so search the ingredient in JEI and follow its uses from fresh plant to dried material to finished drink. Keep each stage in a separately labelled drawer or shelf."
				"The tea room is also a server interface: effects should be labelled, useful expedition drinks kept separate from celebration stock, and finished cups placed where a tired player can understand them without a lecture."
