			description: [
				"Plant flowers near a normal hive and learn to harvest safely. A lit campfire beneath the hive calms its residents; leave space so smoke can reach it."
				"Productive Bees distinguishes vanilla hive bees from solitary bees that live in nests. Use the in-game bee guide and JEI to identify housing, food, breeding parents, and product processing for the species you want."
				"Catch bees with the intended cages instead of killing or dragging them blindly. Keep cages labelled, move one species at a time, and prepare the correct nest, hive, or flower before releasing it."
