			dependencies: ["7F45F36FB147AD0A"]
			description: [
				"Bee Cages move bees without leads or boats. Use one on a bee and release it inside a prepared enclosure. Sturdy cages are reusable."
				"Catch bees with the intended cages instead of killing or dragging them blindly. Keep cages labelled, move one species at a time, and prepare the correct nest, hive, or flower before releasing it."
				"The Apiarists' Oath values continuity over maximum output. Maintain spare breeding stock, protect rare lineages from accidental release, and teach one other player how to recover the apiary if its builder is absent."
